      "statement": "ToolNode distinguishes between validation errors (invalid model-provided arguments) and execution errors (tool logic failures); validation errors are caught and returned as ToolMessage for model retry, while execution errors can be configured to propagate or be caught via handle_tool_errors parameter supporting bool, str, Callable, or Exception type patterns.",
