      "id": "claim_c841ca46f46641f88cf23540176dac1e",
      "statement": "create_react_agent() supports v1 and v2 versions: v1 processes all tool calls from one message in a single ToolNode invocation, while v2 distributes each tool call to separate tool node instances via the Send API, enabling independent state updates and better support for human-in-the-loop interrupts and post_model_hook configuration.",
